#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

cat <<'EOF'
feedback loop

Current status: partial/stub

Choose next loop manually:
  - simple code feedback -> edit code -> make tool run -> make tool present-work
  - bad deliverable contract -> make tool plan and update task contract
  - bad AC/spec scope -> make tool plan and re-plan target AC/spec
  - implementation discovered larger blast radius -> stop and report planning mismatch

Future:
  External orchestration may classify feedback and route to the right loop.
EOF
